    "start": 622,
    "end": 751,
    "quote": "‏ وفي حديث النضر عن شعبة قال وزاد فيه حصين وسليمان قال حصين قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم ‏\"‏ إنما بعثت قاسما أقسم بينكم ‏\"‏ ‏"
   }
  ],
  "only_variant_groups": false,
  "matn_start": 553,
  "notes": [
   "the report has five routes meeting at Ibn Jabir's Companion Jabir through Salim; each route's last written tail («كلهم عن سالم، بن أبي الجعد عن جابر بن عبد الله») is written inline in its group, since the tail sentence is written only once but reaches the routes through differing levels",
   "the route through Muhammad b. Amr (Ibn Ja'far, then Salim) does not write Shu'ba; no link is added for him",
   "«بنحو حديث من ذكرنا حديثهم» and the gloss «يعني ابن جعفر» are left out",
   "«وفي حديث النضر عن شعبة ... زاد فيه حصين وسليمان» names Hasin and Sulayman as adding words to the saying in another version: a variant group, not a route",
   "the bare «محمد» occurrences are counted in the text order; the readings depend on that count, so the occurrence numbers are the thing to check"
  ],
  "tool_notes": []
